  "worked_solution": "We identify the leading term and compute its limit. In this case, we raise the main term of the base polynomial to the given power.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{t\\to \\infty }({t}^{2}+1)^{4} & ={lim}_{t\\to \\infty }({t}^{2})^{4} \\\\  & ={lim}_{t\\to \\infty }{t}^{8} \\\\  & =\\infty \\end{aligned}\n$$",
